{"ID":"20240118145004-5a6ybmo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145004-5a6ybmo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145004-5a6ybmo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145004-1135ra5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164133-a6mif28\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164133-a6mif28\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:147,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:147\u0026#125;","title":"358补01青盐（即戎盐，补肾泻血热）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204154848"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145004-1135ra5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145004-1135ra5","updated":"20240122164104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产于我国内陆青海之盐。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164105-78jga47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164105-78jga47"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】甘咸而寒。入肾经。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164107-acgap12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164107-acgap12"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】助水脏，平血热，坚骨固齿，明目乌发。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164108-n3iq777","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164108-n3iq777"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】治目痛赤涩，吐血溺血，齿舌出血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164109-ljv3nk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164109-ljv3nk5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮制】不假煎炼，方棱，明莹，色青者良。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164114-id15ikq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164114-id15ikq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164115-x21r43f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164115-x21r43f"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】多食伤肺，走血，渗津，发渴。凡血病，哮喘，水肿，消渴人为大忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164104-zpwed9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164104-zpwed9m"}},{"ID":"20240122164116-p4fbtyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164116-p4fbtyd"}},{"ID":"20240122164116-4695ufa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164116-4695ufa","updated":"20240204154449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个增补里面呢第一个，就是专门讲青盐。我们前面讲的卤盐，它里面有湖盐什么的，我们这里专门讨论青盐，单味青盐。青盐，诸位看到是方方小小的绿色的，看起来青青的，颜色就是青色，就是青盐。这是我国大陆青海的盐巴，青海的盐，如果你看那个青藏铁路的特别报道，他们到那个高山的盐湖，就那个东西。那个盐，你想想看有多少盐在上面，我们大家中国人几代，十几亿人来吃，吃个几代也吃不完，那高山的盐还在结晶的盐，你看看，那就是青盐。"}]},{"ID":"20240122164120-kidmvir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164120-kidmvir","updated":"20240204154546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它的性是甘咸而寒，直接入肾经。那过去在青康，青海这一带的人呢，因为它们只食用的盐是青盐，所以说他们在这边的人几乎没有人得到肾结石，在经方里面张仲景有茯苓戎盐汤，里面讲到用这个青盐来打那个肾结石，所以是很好使用的，那你找不到正青盐的话，用滑石也可以的嘛，这个青盐现在一般大陆中医不会用，所以你特别要指明是青盐，要小心，不要拿出来是海盐，青盐跟海盐你一眼就看出来了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"青盐就是青色的，真的就是青色的，海盐就是白色的，一看就看出来了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，骗都骗不了你，青盐，方方的一个个结晶体，方形。"}]},{"ID":"20240122164129-wmcnkr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164129-wmcnkr5","updated":"20240204154808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"入水脏，坚骨固齿，明目乌发。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去我们拿青盐打成粉跟炮附子两等量打成粉来刷牙，来保持牙齿很好不会动摇，那你说如果喝了冰水，这两天每天看到广告打那个西医的牙医，说你牙齿喝点水牙齿会酸了，怎么样，涂这个就好。中国青盐和那个炮附子，你只要刷两天两次再喝冷水看看，马上就好了，中医比他们还快，牙齿还很坚固，用青盐来刷牙，青盐和炮附子刷牙是不是很坚固。真的，你那个牙齿摇动了，会摇动的牙齿啊，你下次用青盐和炮附子两个等量和在一起刷两天以后第三天你去older一个T-bone那个排骨，丁股牛排，你跟他说welldone全部烤熟，咬啊，哇！一点都不痛，牙齿真凶啊，所以青盐非常好用，那过去呢，眼赤目痛吐血逆血齿舌出血都可以使用，然后用青盐来嗽口都可以。不要炮制，颜色是青色的最好。"}]},{"ID":"20240122164133-a6mif28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164133-a6mif28","updated":"20240204154848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位记得，当我们在用攻水的时候，排腹水的时候，盐巴不能用，要忌盐。尤其在使用那个甘遂跟牵牛的时候。这甘遂和牵牛很好玩，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"单用甘遂病人受不了很难过，胀腹啊恶心哪，你单用牵牛也不行，下痢啊肚子痛啊，你两个混在一起一点都没感觉，就在排水，大便排出来，小便也会排一些但绝大部分是大便排出来，等量，就是要忌盐。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}